        "Description": "Good day 47,\rI hope you have your running shoes one, and they are water resistant. Because todays targets are all over town. And it wont always be a easy stroll. Some of the paths are down right poopy. Quite literally you&apos;ll find. A rose by any other name would be just as sweet. Maybe take one with you on this contract. You&apos;re going to the sewers. It smells bad. I&apos;ll leave you to prepare.",
